<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Premium QR Matrix Engine - Universal Converter Pro</title>
    
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Montserrat:wght@300;400;500;600&family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,400..700;1,400..700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    
    <!-- QR Execution Engine -->
    <script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/qrcodejs/1.0.0/qrcode.min.js"></script>

    <style>
        @keyframes luxuryEntrance {
            from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(15px); }
            to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
        }
        @keyframes shimmerText {
            0% { background-position: 0% 50%; }
            50% { background-position: 100% 50%; }
            100% { background-position: 0% 50%; }
        }

        * { box-sizing: border-box; scroll-behavior: smooth; }
        body {
            margin: 0;
            font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;
            color: #f4f4f5;
            background: radial-gradient(circle at center, #1b1b1d 0%, #070708 100%);
            min-height: 100vh;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
            line-height: 1.7;
        }
        h1, h2, h3 {
            font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
            color: #d4af37;
            font-weight: 400;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 950px;
            margin: auto;
            padding: 40px 20px;
            animation: luxuryEntrance 0.5s cubic-bezier(0.25, 1, 0.5, 1) both;
        }
        .back-link {
            display: inline-block;
            color: #a1a1aa;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 11px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1.5px;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            transition: transform 0.2s ease, color 0.2s ease;
            will-change: transform;
        }
        .back-link:hover { color: #d4af37; transform: translateX(-4px); }
        
        .card {
            background: rgba(22, 22, 25, 0.8);
            backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
            padding: 45px 35px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.15);
            box-shadow: 0 30px 60px -15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8);
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }
        h1.main-title {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 2.4rem;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, #fff 0%, #d4af37 50%, #fff 100%);
            background-size: 200% auto;
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            animation: shimmerText 4s linear infinite;
        }
        
        input[type="text"] {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 15px 20px;
            background: #141416;
            border: 1px solid rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.25);
            color: #fff;
            border-radius: 6px;
            outline: none;
            font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;
            font-size: 14px;
            margin: 20px 0;
            transition: border-color 0.2s ease, transform 0.2s ease;
            will-change: transform;
        }
        input[type="text"]:focus { border-color: #d4af37; transform: scale(1.01); }

        button {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #c5a880 0%, #a88960 100%);
            color: #0a0a0b;
            font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;
            font-weight: 600;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1.5px;
            font-size: 11px;
            padding: 14px 28px;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 6px;
            cursor: pointer;
            width: 100%;
            transition: transform 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.25, 1, 0.5, 1), box-shadow 0.2s ease;
            will-change: transform, box-shadow;
        }
        button:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(168, 137, 96, 0.35); }
        button:active { transform: translateY(1px) scale(0.98); }

        #matrixOutput {
            margin: 35px auto 15px auto;
            padding: 20px;
            background: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 8px;
            width: fit-content;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 45px rgba(0,0,0,0.7);
            display: none;
            animation: luxuryEntrance 0.3s ease-out;
        }
        
        footer section {
            margin-bottom: 45px;
            text-align: left;
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.08);
            padding-bottom: 30px;
        }
        footer section p { color: #a1a1aa; font-size: 14px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="container">
    <a href="../index.html" class="back-link">&larr; Return to Central Hub</a>
    
    <div class="card">
        <h1 class="main-title">LUXURY QR GENERATOR</h1>
        <p style="text-align:center; font-size:12px; color:#a1a1aa; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:2px; margin-bottom:25px;">High-Density Vector Generation</p>
        
        <input type="text" id="matrixInput" placeholder="Paste luxury endpoint URL or configurations here...">
        <button id="generateBtn">Compile Matrix Code</button>
        
        <div id="matrixOutput"></div>
    </div>

    <footer>
        <!-- DATA ARRAYS AND STRATEGIC BENEFITS SECTION -->
        <section>
            <h2>📚 Mathematical Matrix Verification</h2>
            <h3>Error Correction Optimization Scales (ECC)</h3>
            <p>Our generator utilizes the elite Reed-Solomon cryptographic architecture at Level H (High). This advanced mathematical layout permits up to 30% structural module degradation or visual obscuration without disrupting structural scanning protocols.</p>

            <h3>Bridging Physical Spaces to Digital Systems</h3>
            <p>Integrating minimalist vector matrices into premium publications, physical environments, or high-end product presentation tags gives users instantaneous access to web properties. This avoids requiring users to type complex structural character models manually, maintaining a clean visual landscape.</p>

            <h3>Zero Call-Home Metrics Collection</h3>
            <p>Unlike dynamic web redirects that track user traffic via external logging databases, our engine renders standalone static codes completely client-side. Your textual variables compile directly into geometric symbols locally, protecting personal operational metrics.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
            <h3>Can these matrix outputs be scanned by standard smartphones?</h3>
            <p>Yes. The standard module alignment blocks fit all modern digital lens decoders natively across both iOS hardware setups and modern Android configurations.</p>
            
            <h3>Is there a programmatic expiration window for generated codes?</h3>
            <p>No. Because these matrix configurations are explicitly static pixel models, they do not rely on remote hosting instances or subscriptions, continuing to route traffic infinitely.</p>
        </section>
    </footer>
</div>

<script>
    const matrixInput = document.getElementById('matrixInput');
    const generateBtn = document.getElementById('generateBtn');
    const matrixOutput = document.getElementById('matrixOutput');

    generateBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {
        const rawString = matrixInput.value.trim();
        if(!rawString) return alert("Please present valid text data parameters.");
        
        matrixOutput.innerHTML = "";
        matrixOutput.style.display = "block";
        
        new QRCode(matrixOutput, {
            text: rawString,
            width: 220,
            height: 220,
            colorDark : "#070708",
            colorLight : "#ffffff",
            correctLevel : QRCode.CorrectLevel.H
        });
    });
</script>
</body>
</html>